te our double integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}3({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A & ={∬}_{Δ}3({r}^{2}{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{r}^{2}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\,r\\,\\text{d}r\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}}{r}^{3}({cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}}{r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }[\\frac{{r}^{4}}{4}]_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =3[\\theta ]_{0}^{2\\pi } \\\\  & =3(2\\pi -0) \\\\  & =6\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535298 true] [17592186342496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342497 13194139535298 true] [17592186342496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342498 13194139535298 true] [17592186342496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342499 13194139535298 true] [17592186342496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342500 13194139535298 true] [17592186342496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342501 13194139535298 true] [17592186342496 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535298 true] [17592186342496 1041 "selection" 13194139535298 true] [17592186342496 1104 #edb/ref 17592186342500 13194139535298 true] [17592186342496 1110 #uuid "536e4f92-a195-54ad-a7a0-09a9a254fa23" 13194139535298 true] [17592186342497 1034 "\\frac{3\\pi }{2}" 13194139535298 true] [17592186342497 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535298 true] [17592186342497 1111 #uuid "c22061c2-11d9-5bdd-a85d-5f30d45acd38" 13194139535298 true] [17592186342498 1034 "3\\pi " 13194139535298 true] [17592186342498 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535298 true] [17592186342498 1111 #uuid "6ab8a9ef-b39b-5231-8806-be4a0c5c7cbe" 13194139535298 true] [17592186342499 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{3}" 13194139535298 true] [17592186342499 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535298 true] [17592186342499 1111 #uuid "6a003214-6ead-5a63-9e20-9ab87bc6ca89" 13194139535298 true] [17592186342500 1034 "6\\pi " 13194139535298 true] [17592186342500 1103 #edb/ref 175